The present invention relates to an electrohydraulic pressure relief valve for a hydraulic system of a passenger automobile. The pressure relief valve includes at least one opening, an inlet channel for fluid, and a venturi outlet channel for ejecting the fluid, a venturi disposed in said venturi outletchannel, between said at least one inlet channel and said outlet channel for diverting portions of a portion of said jet flow emanating from said opening into said outlet channel, said inlet channel and venturi adapted to provide a hydraulic energy storage chamber, a pressure relief chamber, and a surge pressure relief chamber. In some embodiments of the voltage regulator a plurality of diodes are formed to regulate the current of a primary side to an appropriate voltage in response of sensed vehicle speed.
